 consumer gate 只报告 Maven 是否存在，并未执行 Maven consumer；JAR/POM/BOM/sources/javadoc 也没有汇入最终 release staging。\n4. SBOM/signing 在未清空的同一输出目录上自举，可能纳入旧失败产物；签名只覆盖顶层文件。provenance 使用未暂存 index tree，当前 dirty tree 会被错误绑定为 Stage 5 tree。\n5. Remote rollback 新逻辑在候选尚未 activation 时也无条件停止现有 service，安装包上传/解包早期失败可中断正常旧 Host。\n\n这些都直接来自 Stage 6 package/performance/rollback 退出条件，省略会造成错误 green 或升级回归。我会先为它们补最小合同并修正实现，再做 Ubuntu JI-only 容量检查。"},{"id":"tool-call-call_8RR9fE7axs7WYFOLdVv9rFie","kind":"toolCall","title":"Read scripts\\test-stage-gate-contracts.mjs (1 - 80)","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_8RR9fE7axs7WYFOLdVv9rFie","sessionId":"68e1f968-54b4-496d-bb99-eaef21509c3d","seq":1269,"startedSeq":1266,"endedSeq":1269,"timestamp":"1788751300Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":"Read","toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"assistant-thought-root-resp_087e333d66575ae3016a9e2dc89f8087d0a38d86dd8a3b75f1","kind":"thoughtDelta","sessionId":"68e1f968-54b4-496d-bb99-eaef21509c3d","seq":1276,"startedSeq":1272,"endedSeq":1276,"timestamp":"1788751310Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"**Designing activation rollback logic**\n**Adding rollback tests and refining cold start metrics**\n**Implementing repeated cold start measurements**\n**Planning migration measurement implementation**\n**Inspecting event count logic for acceptPrompt**"},{"id":"tool-call-call_5PC88dsZJ0CCdgLOhJblPxLT","kind":"toolCall","title":"Read ji-java\\applications\\ji-host-core\\src\\main\\java\\io\\github\\diodeme\\ji\\host\\MemoryHostStore.java (228 - 342)","status":"completed","toolCallId":"call_5PC88dsZJ0CCdgLOhJblPxLT","sessionId":"68e1f968-54b4-496d-bb99-eaef21509c3d","seq":1281,"startedSeq":1278,"endedSeq":1281,"timestamp":"1788751325Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":"Read","toolDetailAvailable":false}}}},{"id":"tool-call-call_nPoW77qAMiqRC5dEeIqQAlFd","kind":"toolC